      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't think the pricing itself is a problem, but strictly speaking, the more credits you have, the more the price effectively increases. In a typical social game, you get bonus credits, so it's not a problem, but it becomes a problem with currently VRChat's pricing structure.\n\nTherefore, I suggest they should either revise the price or add bonus credits. To be honest, I prefer bonus credits over a price increase. It's nice to feel like you're getting a good deal.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
