  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The price per VRC credit increases with the number of credits purchased at once.\n\nThis is extremely puzzling.\n\nFor example, 600 credits cost $4.99, but 1200 credits cost $9.99, not double $4.99 ($9.98). Similarly, 2400 credits cost $19.99, not double $9.99 ($19.98). The price increases by $0.01 with each additional credit.\n\nAnyone with basic math skills wouldn't implement such a sloppy pricing structure, yet this is what's happening. This needs to be corrected.\n\nAdditionally, please consider these pricing options: one that increases bonus credits ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/creator-economy/p/please-create-credit-bundles-for-larger-quantities-bought ) and another that normalizes prices without setting limits ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/creator-economy/p/standardize-credit-pack-values ).",
